+- **Resolved in the host: modern Chinese codes selected Japanese.** Both settings equality hooks now match `zh-Hans` with `zh-CN`, and `zh-Hant` with `zh-TW`; see [Chinese language aliases in settings comparisons](../../../docs/reference/services.md#chinese-language-aliases-in-settings-comparisons). Upstream checked fresh-save Mac startup menus; this fork's port is covered by the synthetic hook matrix and still needs device validation.
